{"command": "cd /testbed && PYTHONPATH=src:. python -c \"\nfrom cachetools.tagged import TaggedCache\n\n# R07: TTL - at exact boundary, key IS expired per R07\n# put at timer=0, ttl=2 => expiry=2. At timer=2, 2>=2 => expired\n# At timer=1, 1<2 => not expired\nclock = [0]\nc5 = TaggedCache(2, timer=lambda: clock[0])\nc5.put('a', 1, ttl=2)\nassert c5.get('a') == 1  # timer=0, expiry=2, not expired\nclock[0] = 1  # 1 < 2, not expired\nassert c5.get('a') == 1\nclock[0] = 2  # 2 >= 2, EXACTLY at boundary = expired per R07\ntry:\n    c5.get('a')\n    assert False, 'should be expired at boundary'\nexcept KeyError:\n    pass\nclock[0] = 3  # past boundary\ntry:\n    c5.get('a')\n    assert False\nexcept KeyError:\n    pass\nprint('TTL boundary test passed')\n\"\n", "exit_code": 0, "stderr": "", "stdout": "TTL boundary test passed\n"}